	'k06abd5ac' => 'The Rope Keepers',
	'k0943926e' => 'Every commission begins with a free 45-minute first conversation held via video link or in person at Studio 3 in Port Alder. During this initial exchange, we discuss your core subject, key participants, and production timeline. If aligned, we initiate Step 02: up to six weeks of formal research and access. During this research stage, we draft a thorough treatment and secure comprehensive written access agreements with all individuals and institutions before shooting begins.',
