	'k51fede35' => 'All confirmed projects require a 30% deposit upon contract signing before research or shooting commences. Travel expenses, accommodation, and subsistence during field blocks are billed at direct cost without studio markups. Cancellation fees apply on a stepped scale depending on notice given prior to scheduled shoot blocks. Broadcast and distribution rights are outlined in custom agreements, ensuring commissioners receive agreed exhibition terms while protecting participant integrity and original archival footage.',
