	'k7743eb7b' => 'You can subscribe by entering your email address in the field letters form on this page or by writing to propose@utsushi-films.example with the subject Field letters — please add me. We respect your attention and store subscriber details securely without sharing them with outside parties. You can unsubscribe at any point with a single click or by sending a direct note to our studio.',
	'k777b9435' => 'Institutional, 24 min',
	'k7a2fe8c1' => 'We direct commissioned documentaries for public broadcasters, non-governmental organisations, and cultural institutions, alongside self-initiated festival films. Working from our studio in Port Alder, we travel wherever the people in the film work and live, carrying lightweight equipment and avoiding artificial lighting or staged scenes. We do not arrive with pre-written arguments or ready-made answers.',
	'k7a38de71' => 'Ostmere Short Film Forum / Short',
	'k7a93edf8' => 'When you sign up for our monthly Field letters, we store your email address solely to deliver our monthly dispatch on the first Monday of each month. Your address is never used for automated marketing campaigns or rented to external networks. You may withdraw your consent and unsubscribe at any time by following the link in any dispatch or contacting propose@utsushi-films.example.',
