	'kd6667fb0' => '▸ Propose a film',
	'kd675b80d' => 'Proposals are gathered throughout the week and read together by our senior team every Monday. We reply to every serious inquiry within 5 working days. If your proposal aligns with our documentary approach and production capacity, we will invite you to a free 45-minute first conversation, held either via secure video link or in person at Studio 3 in Port Alder. During this initial meeting, we explore creative scope and research feasibility.',
	'kd794e0cd' => 'Utsushi Films is committed to safeguarding personal data and respecting individual privacy rights across our website, production inquiries, and documentary projects. We treat all personal communications with complete confidentiality.',
