	'kee109446' => '04 Night Shift at Ward Nine',
	'kefbc29c5' => 'Full rates ▸',
	'kefc2dfc9' => 'Documentary filmmaking begins with quiet presence rather than recording. We sit at kitchen tables, walk docks at dawn, and share ordinary routines before turning on a microphone. Trust cannot be rushed through production schedules; it is earned by showing up repeatedly without demands.',
