	'kfb7f0862' => 'from €140,000',
	'kfc559b7d' => 'To help us evaluate your commission, please send a concise project outline covering four key elements: the core subject of the film, the key people or community involved, your intended timeframe (&lt;3 months, 3–9 months, or 9+ months), and your budget band matching our commission tiers (such as NGO film, short commission, or broadcast hour). Please also detail any existing access agreements or institutional permissions already in place.',
